    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d544-a1">

                <pb facs="0656" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg574"/>

                <head>[Copy.]</head>

                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chihuahua,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-12-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 1, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am much obliged to you for the information you have given me of Mr. de
                    Courcillon’s assumptions.</p>
                <p>The gentleman is very much mistaken if he thinks I can approve of what has never
                    come to my knowledge.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * * *</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BENITO JUAREZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. Juan N. Navarro, New York.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
